  "project_description": "Adds a new field type based on the DateRangeItem in core which allows you to select the timezone when entering the date. This is useful for specifying dates where the timezone is provided by the content admin and doesn't align with the site timezone or can't always be displayed in the same timezone using the existing formatter options.\n\n Note, this may at some point be added to the existing field types in core. [#2632040]",
